<title>FINLAND: HONKARAKENNE JAN-AUG LOSS NARROWS.</title>
<headline>HONKARAKENNE JAN-AUG LOSS NARROWS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p>Loss before extraordinary items,</p>
<p> taxes					   0.6 vs 7.9 loss</p>
<p> Loss per share (markka)		  0.33 vs 2.05 loss</p>
<p> Net sales				   192.9 vs 202.0</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation 18.1 vs 13.3</p>
<p> Operating profit after depreciation   5.0 vs 0.6 loss</p>
<p> Extraordinary gain			  0.1 vs nil</p>
<p> Extraordinary charge			2.0 vs 0.7</p>
<p> Loss before reserves, tax		 2.5 vs 8.6 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish logwood house maker is Honkarakenne Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0248</p>
